# Godot

- Godot 4.x
- Typed GDScript where practical
- Small focused scripts
- Clear ownership
- Composition preferred
- No unnecessary autoload
- No giant manager
- Avoid duplicated logic
- No speculative systems
- Fix parser/runtime errors before declaring success

```gdscript
# Bad: untyped global manager
# Good: small typed script with one owner
func _apply_theme(profile: ThemeProfile) -> void:
	pass
```
